# Bulk import rules

- Accept `.txt` and `.md` files.
- Extract every valid http/https URL with a robust regex (`findall`, not one-per-line `search`).
- Ignore empty lines. `#` comments without a URL are ignored; lines like `# https://…` still yield the URL.
- Support: bare URLs (watch, /shorts/, youtu.be, query strings), markdown `[text](url)`, `Title | URL`, inline URLs, UTF-8 and UTF-16 files.
- Dedupe against existing queue URLs and download archive.
- Always preview counts and require confirmation before enqueue. Never auto-start.
